      },
      "text": "```\n  STREPSIRRHINI (\"wet-nosed\"):\n  - Moist rhinarium (like cats/dogs) — enhanced olfaction\n  - Tapetum lucidum: reflective layer behind retina (eyeshine)\n  - Dental comb: front lower teeth form a comb for grooming\n  - More reliant on smell, less reliant on vision than anthropoids\n  - Examples: ring-tailed lemur, aye-aye, slow loris, galago"
    }
